SUMMARY:Joshua Live Movie from Sight & Sound
DESCRIPTION:Sight & Sound’s brand-new premiere show\, JOSHUA\, is marching towards movie theaters all across the country! \nJourney alongside the people of Israel as they navigate their new-found freedom in an unforgiving wilderness. When Joshua is called to replace Moses as their faithful leader\, tensions mount in the midst of dwindling supplies and approaching armies. With one last fortified city standing between the Israelites and the Promised Land\, unexpected help emerges from behind enemy lines and Joshua’s trust in God’s plan is put to the ultimate test. \nFilmed in front of a live audience\, this special event invites you to experience one of the most redemptive stories of the Bible come to life like never before! JOSHUA – Live! is coming to movie theaters nationwide beginning October 30.
