SUMMARY:Joy To The World with Servant Stage
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with Joy To The World – a beloved return of Servant Stage’s original Christmas revue! Bursting with festive music\, joyful dancing\, and heartwarming moments\, this spirited show features favorite carols and holiday classics from around the world. With stunning harmonies\, lively choreography\, and a talented cast spreading cheer\, Joy To The World is a celebration of hope\, love\, and the true meaning of Christmas. Perfect for the whole family\, this joyous production will fill your heart with holiday spirit! \nAll shows are Pay-What-You-Will in keeping with Servant Stage’s mission to make exceptional performances accessible to everyone. You are welcome to donate by cash\, check\, or credit card at the performance\, or online or by mail at any time. Thank you for your support that makes the mission of Servant Stage possible!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/joy-to-the-world-with-servant-stage/
