SUMMARY:Koziar's Christmas Village
DESCRIPTION:Step inside Koziar’s Christmas Village and revel in the beauty of a valley glowing with over a million Christmas lights.\nYour Winter Wonderland tour will include these beautiful glass building displays\, gift and snack shop\, and more\, for an experience of a lifetime. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSANTA’S POST OFFICE\nOLD-FASHIONED BAKERY SHOP\nTHE NIGHT BEFORE CHRISTMAS\nTHE KISSING BRIDGE\nBEAUTIFUL MANGER SCENE\nTOY MAKER & HIS TOY SHOP\nCHRISTMAS BENEATH THE SEA\nCHRISTMAS IN OTHER LANDS\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWalk at your own pace self-guided tours of the breathtaking grounds and beautiful lights — plus 11 indoor buildings of varying sizes to enter with displays\, shopping\, food\, and a huge indoor train display! \nCROWD FAVORITE! INDOOR AND OUTDOOR TRAIN DISPLAYS \n\n\nKoziar’s Christmas Village Calendar
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/koziars-christmas-village/
LOCATION:Koziar’s Christmas Village\, 782 Christmas Village Rd\, Bernville\, PA\, 19506\, United States
