SUMMARY:Lancaster City Scavenger Hunt
DESCRIPTION:The Ultimate Lancaster Scavenger Hunt – Adventure\, History & Hidden Gems!\nThis is the best way to explore Lancaster City – hands down!  \nGrab your friends or family\, join our app\, and get ready for a really fun time. The start time of this event is between \n12:00 PM and 1:15 pm. You can complete all 3 hours of hands-on activities or stop whenever you are ready. \nThe longer you stay in the game\, the more freebies and local treats you earn from small businesses in downtown. \nChildren under 6 years old are free with an adult ticket
