SUMMARY:Dutch Winter Wonderland
DESCRIPTION:Make the Holidays Even More Cheerful at Our Winter Wonderland Event!\n\nJoin us this holiday season as our park transforms into a Winter Wonderland! Decorated in thousands of lights and holiday ornaments\, Dutch Winter Wonderland becomes a true winter marvel that you won’t want to miss out on this holiday season. \nOur decorated holiday park event won an award for “The Best Theme Park Holiday Event – 2021”. It’s an excellent place to enjoy Christmas activities for kids and to soak up the holiday cheer alongside the whole family! \nImmerse yourself into the spirit of the holidays during our Dutch Winter Wonderland event\, where you can enjoy over 20 rides and attractions. Meet Santa to tell him your wishlist for this Christmas\, and marvel at our thousands of holiday lights which are strung around the entire park! \nBuy your Dutch Winter Wonderland tickets today! If you’ll be attending our event with a group\, be sure to inquire about our group rates and discount offers. Gold and platinum season pass holders receive automatic entry to the event. \nCelebrate the most joyful time of the year alongside your loved ones as you discover our park all lit up and laced with holiday cheer. Our Dutch Winter Wonderland eagerly awaits you!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/dutch-winter-wonderland-2/
LOCATION:Dutch Wonderland Family Amusement Park\, 2249 Lincoln Hwy\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
