SUMMARY:Root’s Old Mill Flea Market
DESCRIPTION:Come to Root’s Old Mill Flea Market and experience the thrill of discovering hidden treasures around every corner!\nFrom vintage artwork and antique lamps to heirloom furniture and one-of-a-kind collectibles\, you never know what you’ll find waiting for you at Root’s. \nBring the whole family and enjoy browsing 175+ vendor stands offering a variety of antiques\, collectibles\, estate jewelry\, household treasures\, tools\, decor\, and so much more—indoors and outdoors. \nInterested in becoming a Flea Market vendor? Reservations are required for Tuesday market. Requests may be placed by calling (717) 898-7443 beginning at the end of market day (3pm on Tuesday) through Monday at 12 noon. Vendor spaces on Tuesday start at $20.\nSaturday Flea Market spaces are first come\, first served. Only $10! Vendors who participate on Saturdays receive priority placement for Tuesdays.\n*Please mention if you’re bringing a trailer or large vehicle\, so that we may better accommodate you. \nBe sure to check our calendar of events to confirm Root’s Saturday Flea Market dates and times. \n\nAdditional Shopping & Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nAmish Products\nConsignment and Thrift Shops\nFarmers Markets\nFurniture\n\n\n\nQuilt Supplies and Fabrics\nGifts & Collectibles\nTheater\, Music\, & the Arts\nKids’ Attractions\nAdults & Couples\n\n\n\nRailroad Attractions\nHistorical & Educational\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar
