DESCRIPTION:It’s time again for our Annual Fall Open House! November 7\, 8 and 14\, 15. \nSaturdays 10:00-4:00 Sundays 12:00-4:00 \nPet\, feed or lead an alpaca! Wagon rides and barrel train rides! Obstacle course demo and learn basic facts about alpacas! \nWJTL’s Cookie Break will be here on Saturday\, November 7 from 10:00 – 12:00. \nA food stand is available and of course our store is stocked with 1000’s of items! \nDonations are greatly appreciated to help cover expenses. Also\, please leave your pets at home. \nCome and enjoy the day. Bring a friend!
