SUMMARY:Frozen at Tanger
DESCRIPTION:We’re SO excited to host Frozen at Tanger \n\nA FREE Holiday Family Event for our community! \n\nBring the family and join Koch Garpstas Realty Group at Tanger Outlets Lancaster for an afternoon full of holiday fun\, activities\, and a little Frozen magic! \n Anna & Elsa will be making a special appearance We’ll be showing Frozen Crafts and activities for the kids Giveaways throughout the event WIN $1\,000 – one lucky winner will take home $1\,000 CASH! Community donation drive\n\nWe’ll also have a donation table set up and will be collecting new socks\, blankets\, and diapers to help support families in our local community. If you’re able\, bring an item along and help us give back this holiday season. \n\nThis event is completely FREE and open to the community. Whether you’re one of our clients\, friends\, neighbors\, or just looking for something fun to do with the family\, we’d love to have you join us!\n\n Tanger Outlets Lancaster – Playground Area FREE admission
