SUMMARY:Christmas in Perfect Harmony: Joy Has Come! at The Barn at Paradise Station
DESCRIPTION:All new for 2026! This original concert experience is sure to be an unforgettable part of your holiday season and become a new tradition! Half-part musical theater nostalgia\, half-part worship concert\, Perfect Harmony sings stunning original arrangements of favorite holiday classics in (of course) three-part PERFECT HARMONY. Complete with beautiful costumes\, theatrical sets\, lighting\, sound\, and a live band\, this fully immersive experience will have you feeling the true Spirit of the Season! \nPlaying at The Barn at Paradise Station in Lancaster County\, PA\, select dates November 11-December 30\, 2026 and to select touring locations. \nRun time is approximately 1 hour and 45 minutes with one 15 minute intermission. Hot chocolate and light concessions\, as well as Perfect Harmony merchandise will be available for sale during the performance. \n​The Barn at Paradise Station is fully climate-controlled\, ADA with elevator available and restrooms. Ample bus parking. \nSpecial group pricing available. Call to inquire. \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
