SUMMARY:A Very Grinchy Christmas Tree Lighting! in Elizabethtown\, PA
DESCRIPTION:Bring your family and friends to downtown Elizabethtown for an evening full of festive fun\, sweet treats\, and plenty of Whoville cheer! \nHere’s what’s happening throughout the night:\nCookie Decorating – Create your own delicious holiday masterpiece with the Free Masons of Abraham C. Triechler Lodge No. 682\nLive Performances – Enjoy local choirs\, dancers\, and musicians with your Host DJ Jimmy Jam\, bringing the spirit of the season to life. Check back for the entertainment line up!\n Whoville Village – Step into a storybook scene filled with lights\, laughter\, and holiday magic and meet The Grinch!\n Photo Ops with The Grinch & Santa – Don’t miss your chance to snap a pic with the holiday’s most famous duo!\n Coloring Contest with Mars Wrigley – Kids can get creative for sweet prizes!\n Trolley Rides – Take a free cozy ride through twinkling downtown streets provided by Stone Gables Estate!!\n Downtown Scavenger Hunt – Explore local shops and uncover Grinchy surprises!\n Food Trucks – Warm up with delicious bites and festive drinks. Come back for the line up!\n Downtown Decorating Contest – See Elizabethtown transform into a cheerful Christmas Experience! Pick up a voting sheet at the Discover Elizabethtown Tent next to the Stage and then scroll downtown and help us judge what business downtown decorated the best this year!!! Return to the DE tent and turn your votes back in! The winning businesses will be announced and awarded during December’s 2nd Friday Downtown Event!\n The night wraps up with the lighting of the town tree – a moment you won’t want to miss! Be sure to bring along your Bells as we use the Power of the Bells to light the tree!!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/e-town-tree-lighting/
LOCATION:Downtown Elizabethtown\, Elizabethtown\, PA\, 17022\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family Events,Christmas - Visit Santa,Christmas Events in Lancaster County,Christmas Tour,Christmas Tree Lighting,Elizabethtown,Food & Beverage Events,Outdoor Activities
